cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If OpenKartLine contributes to your research, please cite the software and
  the exact release or commit used so its model and solver assumptions remain
  reproducible.
title: OpenKartLine
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-07
authors:
  - name: OpenKartLine contributors
abstract: >-
  An open-source, local-first application for authoring kart circuits,
  simulating physically constrained racing lines and speed profiles, and
  explaining braking, apex, and acceleration references.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Navesz/openkartline
url: https://navesz.github.io/openkartline/
keywords:
  - karting
  - racing line
  - lap-time simulation
  - trajectory optimization
  - vehicle dynamics
